    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Discovering Mathematics Year 1 is creatuvely designed to attract children to learn Mathemathical concepts through a whole new, fully-interactive experience! Based on the KBSR syllabus, it is jam-packed with colourful animations, videos and delightful characters to keep the children entertained and to build up essential vocabulary. This program enhances critical and creative thinking skills (CCTS), as children try to solve the replayable and interactive problems. A corresponding activity book is included to reinforce understanding of KBSR skills.</marc:subfield>
